 "titulo": "The earthquake that skipped the houses and hit the towers 🇲🇽 #engineering #shorts",
 "capa": "350 KM AWAY",
 "descripcion": "In 1985 an earthquake struck 350 km from Mexico City, yet the city was hit hardest, and mostly mid-size buildings fell. The old lake under the city turned the shaking into a trap.\n\nWhat should we explain next?\n\n#engineering #earthquake #mexicocity #physics #shorts",
